<title>VENEZUELA: ADVISORY - Venezuela's banks and markets closed.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Venezuela's banks and markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and markets are closed on Monday for the All Saints' Day national holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
